; The scaffolding shared by the two whole-file instrumenters
; (ppx/coverage and ppx/mutate): the exclusion-attribute grammar, the
; lazy trivial-value guard, module-name mangling, the generated preamble
; frame, and the entry filter. The traversals themselves stay separate -
; they are properly distinct engines - so this library deliberately has
; no opinion about what gets inserted, only about everything around it.
;
; Private to the ppx_windtrap package: it is rewriter-side machinery,
; linked into ppx drivers and never into instrumented code, so it
; carries no ppx_runtime_libraries and must never be a public name user
; code can reach for.

(library
 (name windtrap_ppx_scaffold)
 (package ppx_windtrap)
 (libraries ppxlib)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
